## Localization (i18n)

Locations:
- Provider and hooks: `src/contexts/LanguageContext.tsx`
- Resources: `src/locales/*.json`

### Usage
```tsx
import { useLanguage } from "@/contexts/LanguageContext";
const { t, language, setLanguage } = useLanguage();
const title = t("modules.crm");
```

### Notes
- `t(key)` falls back to English if missing.
- Normalize DB-localized fields (e.g., `'nl-BE'` -> `'nl'`).
- Never hard-code user-facing strings.
